&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;VP, Strategic Data Science&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the strategic data-science capability within our &lt;strong&gt;Open Intelligence Solutions (OIS)&lt;/strong&gt; domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This is a newly defined senior leadership role for someone who can combine &lt;strong&gt;deep data-science expertise with strong media, marketing and commercial understanding&lt;/strong&gt;. You’ll sit at the intersection of data science, product, clients and commercial strategy, turning complex data and business challenges into advanced modelling approaches, actionable insights and scalable analytical solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll shape how we use data science to understand audiences and consumer behaviour, improve measurement and forecasting, automate consumer research, generate insight and develop synthetic populations and panels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This is not a role focused solely on technical delivery. You’ll be a senior strategic partner to clients and internal stakeholders, helping define &lt;strong&gt;what we should build, why it matters and how data science can create measurable business value&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Lead our strategic data-science capability&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the vision, strategy and operating model for data science across domain intelligence solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set best practices and standards for how advanced analytics supports client, product and commercial priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of audience definition, segmentation and behavioural modelling approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex data into actionable audience and consumer intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn client needs and commercial opportunities into clear modelling roadmaps, analytical frameworks and reusable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Drive measurement, forecasting and insight&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish best practices across measurement, media effectiveness and insight generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead forecasting and predictive analytics across audience, consumer and media intelligence use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and scale consumer-research automation approaches that increase the speed, consistency and depth of insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of &lt;strong&gt;synthetic populations and synthetic panels&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring methodologies are credible, interpretable and commercially useful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure analytical approaches are rigorous, explainable and capable of being applied across real client challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Partner with clients and lead teams&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior client and stakeholder partner, shaping solutions that have clear commercial relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product, Commercial, Consumer Research, Measurement, Forecasting, Audience Strategy and Applied Data Science teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic direction across flagship data-science initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop senior applied data scientists working across audience and segmentation modelling, consumer and media intelligence, forecasting, predictive analytics, synthetic populations and panels, and media effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set quality standards that ensure our work is rigorous, scalable, reusable and commercially valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We’re looking for an experienced data-science leader who can operate comfortably between &lt;strong&gt;strategy, technology and commercial delivery&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading &lt;strong&gt;data science, advanced analytics or applied data-science teams&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in areas such as &lt;strong&gt;audience modelling, segmentation, behavioural modelling, forecasting, predictive analytics, measurement or consumer intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of &lt;strong&gt;media, marketing and/or advertising&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to apply data science to real-world commercial challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating complex client or business problems into practical analytical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of developing methodologies, frameworks or analytical products that can be scaled and reused.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of measurement and media effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with senior clients and stakeholders and communicating complex technical concepts in a clear, commercially relevant way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to provide strategic direction while remaining close enough to the technical detail to challenge assumptions and maintain high standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership skills, with experience developing senior data-science talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re open&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;We are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re optimistic&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span id=&quot;628d56ad5d8a35dab853e65d9daa237c&quot; class=&quot;editor-module-hl-green-solid&quot;&gt;We believe&lt;/span&gt; in the power of creativity, technology and talent to create brighter futures or our people, our clients and our communities. We approach all that we do with conviction: to try the new and to seek the unexpected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt; we are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;ll give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/strong&gt; – We aim to create a culture in which people can do extraordinary work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; – We offer the opportunity to create, influence and complete projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/strong&gt; – Unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers. Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

